    "id": "PL01",
    "kind": "static-derived",
    "statement": "Plain Plant starts growth.15/age0/unlit0/sownfalse; Sowing is growth<.0001, Mature is growth>.999. Initial generation uses clamp(U(.15,1.5)) plus independent random age below LifespanTicks-50; later natural spawn defaults to .15/age0.",
