    "id": "PL02",
    "kind": "static-derived",
    "statement": "Growth per source tick is fertility*temperature*light*optional-condition-factors/(60000*growDays), gated by Growing stage, local rest time (<.25 or >.8), blight, growth season and vacuum. TickLong adds2000 ticks and caps growth1. Plain plants still rest with artificial illumination.",
