    "id": "PL05",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "statement": "Trees inherit Ground sowing, work4000/Plants6/TreeSowing/mustBeWildToSow. Menu availability checks finished research then map AllWildPlants membership, not living same-species presence. Null research list returns true before further flags. TreeSowing declares1000/Neolithic/TribalStart; starting-unlocked depends on scenario.",
