        "xml_record": "ThingDef_TreeBase"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "PL08",
    "kind": "static-derived",
    "statement": "Sow creates a physical growth0/sowntrue plant; completed sow becomes.0001. Progress accumulates PlantWorkSpeed*delta and is saved; interrupted unfinished sow destroys the plant in finish action. Final path checks revalidate neighbors and cell plantability.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "food",
        "type": "RimWorld.JobDriver_PlantSow",
        "line_start": 13,
        "line_end": 89
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "PL09",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "statement": "HarvestableNow is strictly growth>min (.4 trees/.2 Saguaro). CanYieldNow also requires positive yield and no blight. Yield expectation is base*(.5+.5*InverseLerp(min,1,growth))*(.5+.5*HP/maxHP)*difficulty; nonnegative result is stochastically rounded.",
    "sources": [
