    "id": "PL11",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "statement": "Cut and Chop both use shared PlantWork yield; Cut is not universally no-drop. Work rate=PlantWorkSpeed*Lerp(3.3,1,growth); tree harvestFailablefalse prevents ordinary failure, but harvest stat>1 scales integer yield and rounds again. Placement is Near actor and not proven lossless.",
