  {
    "id": "PL15",
    "kind": "static-derived",
    "statement": "Every long tick updates unlitTicks by2000 when light factor<=.001 (otherwise reset0), then age by2000 even at night/cold/maturity. After update, age>LifespanTicks or unlitTicks>450000 causes.005HP/tick, combined by max and rounded up over2000ticks (10HP). 7.5days marks a grace threshold, not a guaranteed death date.",
    "sources": [
